{"id":474,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"カトリック教育で人格を育む百合学院","feature_description":"百合学院中学校は、カトリックの理念に基づき、知的・道徳的・宗教的情操教育で円満な人格を育てる学校です。6年間の流れや学習指導の特色、英語教育、キャリア教育が整い、放課後のクラブ活動や課外レッスンも含めて、日常の中で自分を伸ばしやすい環境があります。学校紹介と教育方針が明確で、学びの軸を持ちやすい点も特徴です。生徒の興味に合わせて活動を選びやすい構成です。","clubs":[{"id":9389,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9390,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9391,"name":"チアダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9392,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9393,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9394,"name":"プログラミング研究会","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9395,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9396,"name":"フォークソング部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9397,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9398,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9399,"name":"家庭科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":9400,"name":"アンサンブル部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jrhigh.yuri-gakuin.ac.jp/category/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"}],"profile_sources":[{"id":1627,"attribute_key":"religious_back